  "id": "total-sum-of-squares",
  "term": "total sum of squares",
  "definition": "Total sum of squares is the overall amount of variation in a set of scores. In effect size reporting, it serves as the full variability term used when calculating eta squared, where the effect sum of squares is divided by the total sum of squares to show the proportion of variance associated with group membership.",
